issue from the primary tumor, including all sectioning techniques and bone marrow biopsies. This includes samples of the primary tumor from autopsies. Histological examination of tissue from a metastasis, including at autopsy.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-DiagnosticConfirmationCS.html#DiagnosticConfirmationCS-9\">9</a></td><td>Unknown</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
